# Changelog

All notable changes to integrityX are documented in this file.

[V0.5.0] - 2026-09-17

## Added

- integrityX project branding.
- Kairo Integrity Engine identity.
- Initial documentation set.
- Environment diagnostics documentation.
- WebUI documentation.
- Configuration documentation.
- Troubleshooting guide.
- Development guide.

## Changed

- Project terminology standardized around "integrityX".
- Documentation references the existing module ID "playintegrityfix".
- Documentation structure reorganized for easier maintenance.

## Notes

- This release is primarily a project and documentation milestone.
- Integrity behavior remains dependent on the Android environment and server-side services.

---

[Unreleased]

## Planned

- More detailed environment diagnostics.
- Improved logging.
- Additional compatibility checks.
- Improved module configuration interface.
- Additional Kairo Integrity Engine components.
